      "persistentUuid": "1fd2d5df-7129-4dcd-b7ac-bcad1b00e582",
      "type": "BBText::BBText",
      "variables": [],
      "effects": [],
      "behaviors": [],
      "content": {
        "text": "[b][size=22]About The Patch Project[/size][/b]\n\n[size=16]The Patch Project is a patch sheet designer and editor that lets you create, manage, and explore synth patches with an intuitive visual interface.[/size]\n\n[b][size=18]How It Works[/size][/b]\n\n[b][size=16]Detail Button[/size][/b]\n[size=15]Toggles the visibility of knob and switch functions on the synth interface, giving you a cleaner view when you need it.[/size]\n\n[b][size=16]Patch Bay Button[/size][/b]\n[size=15]Opens or closes the patch bay popup.\n  • In [b]Editor Mode[/b], drag between an input and output point to draw a cable connection.\n  • Right-click on a point to remove a cable.\n  • In [b]Loading Mode[/b], patches are premade — no connections required.[/size]\n\n[b][size=16]Patch Selector[/size][/b]\n[size=15]  • Click a patch to open the loading page and view its details and patch bay layout.\n  • Right-click a patch to preview the selected sound.[/size]\n\n[b][size=16]Patch Library[/size][/b]\n[size=15]  • Upload patches using [b]Command + U[/b]. All uploads are reviewed and tested before being added to the library.\n  • Note: Text box contents are not currently uploaded, but you can share details in the description text box.[/size]\n\n[b][size=18]What's New in version 1.3.1[/size][/b]\n[size=15]\n- Fixed an issue that caused patch connections to be drawn on the menu.\n\n- Updated the menu bar to better fit the new menu design.\n\n- Other bug fixes & improvements. \n\n\n\n\nDeveloped by: Connor_ed (Connor Edgington-Desmet)\nGitHub: https://github.com/Connor-ed/The-Patch-Project[/size]",
        "opacity": 255,
        "fontSize": 20,
        "visible": true,
        "color": "255;255;255",
        "fontFamily": "Arial",
        "align": "left",
        "verticalTextAlignment": "top"
      }
    }
  ],
